    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you can, add the game to your wishlist, it helps us a lot! &lt;3</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Home decoration simulator game. The game is still in the development phase, but can already be purchased in advance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302620/extras/04c4e623fc1d793fc34ce1a3b1a1178c.poster.avif?t=1733704039\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302620/extras/04c4e623fc1d793fc34ce1a3b1a1178c.webm?t=1733704039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302620/extras/04c4e623fc1d793fc34ce1a3b1a1178c.mp4?t=1733704039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >home decor:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your home as you wish with various objects for the kitchen, living room, bedroom, bathroom, garden, and decoration.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302620/extras/00c7a687830f6d6d2b955d916503ffc3.poster.avif?t=1733704039\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302620/extras/00c7a687830f6d6d2b955d916503ffc3.webm?t=1733704039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302620/extras/00c7a687830f6d6d2b955d916503ffc3.mp4?t=1733704039\" type=\"video/mp4\"><